  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Volume made of cardboard with yellow fabric wrapped around lower half. Scene of colorful flowers made of paper mounted affixed on front and back cover. Illustration of Vagia lamp on back cover along with text. Text on white paper with cardboard illustrations mounted in front and middle of book. Index printed on cardboard sheet.</subfield>
